---
to: "generated/scim/ash_resource_design.md"
force: true
sparql:
  resources: |
    PREFIX scim: <https://ggen.dev/ontology/scim-lifecycle#>
    PREFIX apg:  <https://ggen.dev/ash-projection#>
    SELECT ?domainModule ?moduleName ?resourceName ?schemaUrn ?pkAttr
           ?attrName ?ashType ?isPk
    WHERE {
      ?target a scim:AshProjectionTarget ;
              scim:ashDomainModule ?domainModule ;
              scim:ashModuleName ?moduleName ;
              scim:ashResourceName ?resourceName ;
              scim:sourceSchemaUrn ?schemaUrn ;
              scim:primaryKeyAttribute ?pkAttr ;
              apg:attribute ?attr .
      ?attr apg:attributeName ?attrName ;
            apg:ashType ?ashType ;
            apg:primaryKey ?isPk .
    }
    ORDER BY ?moduleName ?attrName
---
# Ash resource design surface (no runtime Elixir)

Generated by `scim-lifecycle-pack` from `scim:AshProjectionTarget` individuals.
Design input for a later `mix ash.gen.resource` / Igniter lane. This pack emits
no `.ex` files and pins no hex packages.

| Domain | Module | Resource | Schema URN | PK attr | Attribute | Ash type | Is PK |
|--------|--------|----------|------------|---------|-----------|----------|-------|
{% for row in resources %}| `{{ row.domainModule }}` | `{{ row.moduleName }}` | `{{ row.resourceName }}` | `{{ row.schemaUrn }}` | `{{ row.pkAttr }}` | `{{ row.attrName }}` | `{{ row.ashType }}` | {{ row.isPk }} |
{% endfor %}

### Explicit non-goals (this pack)

- No `Ash.Resource` modules
- No Phoenix router / ash_json_api controllers
- No credential storage (gate `050_no_password_literal` + `scim:UserShape` refuse `scim:password`)
- No DO authority: declaring a User/Group never provisions an identity
